{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "14003153bcd586861572083fc58b2d685f8d6842398bcab07e3b3a98aebcba09", "ja": "ガイコツのトルソーさん、動いちゃダメ！\nさあ、みんなで無限のボビンを回しましょう♪", "zh": "骷髅人体模特先生，不可以动哦！\n来吧，大家一起转动无数的梭芯吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1001_p", "source_sha256": "527ffde0cd8a5ae4b1e980494377bead92699b27bae96ca3f4cb1dbeb736e07c", "ja": "（この声は青羽さん……みんなって事は、\nアイドル達と一緒に作業でもしてるのかな？　よし）", "zh": "（这个声音是青羽小姐……说“大家”，难道是和偶像们一起在做什么吗？好）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1002_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1003_p", "source_sha256": "be3b129ba1280a13b3df3ba879c2445dc27ba52f7f2492bd829c688c6dc6f901", "ja": "お疲れさまです！\n青羽さんと……あれ、他には誰もいない……？", "zh": "辛苦了！\n青羽小姐和……咦，其他人都不在……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "3971fc423fdc038deea096f86464fcefdaf016fe44aa4174397f8bddc728f573", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！？\nお疲れさまです……！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！？\n辛苦了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1005_p", "source_sha256": "234993c35de8deb1c665f23d42bffbef0950bf0ea9f12511f95f1d210d0f1c92", "ja": "おかしいな……。青羽さんが、誰かと\n話をしていたように聞こえたんですが……。", "zh": "奇怪……我刚才好像听到青羽小姐在和谁说话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "9c3d2457f9bb2a0661a26d04d66c3d3a8265adaf23fbfd070d01c66469121b8a", "ja": "それは……ちょっぴり、魔法を使っていた\nものですから……えへへ♪", "zh": "那是因为……刚才稍微用了一点魔法……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "38bd5d72bd6705a1b44ca06b5eee8e678c74064a942b08e4b020c9a2c05c33f2", "ja": "魔法？", "zh": "魔法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "897cba0db58ee44b64181c607630670895f4991dd9cf07b51fec9fd9655c54d9", "ja": "はい！　待ち針のサボテンさんや、\nウッドボタンのクマさんと一緒に！", "zh": "是的！和针插仙人掌，还有木扣小熊一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "d5b95499ffc1b911d80a4fd05101bc36e56f848479fd2bca6f09b1bbaa2d0914", "ja": "？？？　あっ、魔法で思い出した！\n例の企画の件で、動きがあると聞いたんですが……。", "zh": "？？？　啊，说到魔法我想起来了！我听说之前那个企划有进展了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "fe09103599d8fbaed6e31df4138d9a230f16b8054e75ae2a4b38fbddcfdd6242", "ja": "あっ、その件なら、社長さんからうかがってます！\n時間ができたら、事務所に来てほしいそうです。", "zh": "啊，说到那件事，我已经听社长说过了！\n他说您有空的话，希望您能来事务所一趟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6c70aa54d0b2038ba119a6b132eebd433d31bfa84b2bb72456e19045796d08c8", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nそれじゃあすぐ、事務所に向かうことにします！", "zh": "谢谢你！\n那我这就去事务所一趟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "d4d9eda708ab9fac31c27d29c63d15212e0a32bdee33fa7758581b8ebe5ec431", "ja": "いってらっしゃ～い♪　……ふう、ごまかせたかな。\nみんな、お部屋でお裁縫の続きをしようね♪", "zh": "路上小心～♪　……呼，算是蒙混过去了吧。\n大家，回房间继续做针线活吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1013_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1014_president", "source_sha256": "5303c5c1c7ea1c729d457dd7b3d4c32243a36ddd8f243ccb4020d96d7ef1c9e4", "ja": "やあ君、よく来てくれたね！\n立ち話もなんだ、その椅子にかけてくれたまえ。", "zh": "嗨，你来了啊！\n一直站着聊天也不太好，请坐那边的椅子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1015_p", "source_sha256": "7dabd2fd66b5309aef4e62ad450cc0f1fc05a8420914f748587cc9220a294aa4", "ja": "では、失礼します。社長、例の企画に\n進展があったとうかがったのですが……。", "zh": "那我就失礼了。社长，我听说那个企划\n有进展了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "7de891a25e39dd972393ab436374021fc4a569aacfe19cb4e3d86974b30f0d3e", "ja": "早速その話だなんて、{$P$}さんは\nお仕事熱心ですね。はい、お茶をどうぞ。", "zh": "一上来就聊那个话题，{$P$}先生还真是热心工作呢。来，请喝茶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "20afdb03e95109a591ca7ca0ca85cc1dde2f6a7eab0d6b72aaf81559d72a75cb", "ja": "あっ、ありがとうございます。\nすみません、気が逸ってしまって……。", "zh": "啊，谢谢您。\n抱歉，我有点太心急了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1018_president", "source_sha256": "fbcab61153d1b372203b06cb9bbf9979d66f8897fe2ff20f2be66bc1c97d1c5f", "ja": "はっはっは！　それぐらいの意気込みでなくてはね。\nでは、前置きなしで、本題に入ろう！", "zh": "哈哈哈！没有这样的干劲可不行。\n那么，不绕弯子了，直接进入正题吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1019_president", "source_sha256": "5af478c76ef82e7920e81c5948cee8aaa1b9b9c8981715cf842c4b1bdfeafd17", "ja": "以前、矢吹可奈君と伊吹翼君達が出演した映画。\n確かテーマは、魔法世界の学園物、だったかな。", "zh": "以前由矢吹可奈和伊吹翼等人出演的电影。\n我记得主题是魔法世界的校园故事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1020_president", "source_sha256": "8f57aa686d37efc8821e945c9d82ad069f295c7debda468e3bda1a1c6ec0c686", "ja": "その新たな展開として、ドラマ化が決定した！\nもちろん、765プロのアイドル全員出演だ！", "zh": "作为新的企划发展，已经决定改编成电视剧了！  \n当然，765事务所的偶像将全员出演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1021_p", "source_sha256": "9a2b232edab1a91b0f30d2eb4905d08965a0c8264af2d24ad0be96f3728f0e5c", "ja": "ついに……！", "zh": "终于……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1022_101kot", "source_sha256": "292ea8d448ea0149a5ae9f57967047d8989314ace9fb14b1aadc2235a20e23b2", "ja": "とっても素敵な映画でしたからね！　翼ちゃんと\n可奈ちゃんのライバル関係も、私の好みで……♪", "zh": "因为那是一部非常棒的电影嘛！翼和可奈的竞争关系也很符合我的喜好……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1023_president", "source_sha256": "7008c2e136787128d2aae03ce9ca18a9065f7860a8aed7e1d8f25ed5c687e3c2", "ja": "今回のドラマ化では、映画の内容をリメイクしつつ、\n他の登場人物達についても色々と語られるとの事だ。", "zh": "据说这次改编成电视剧时，会在重制电影内容的同时，也讲述其他登场人物的各种事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1024_president", "source_sha256": "de210b57bfc128d80a3da2b962e10b554ce749f5818244fc15bc86f2999d2c94", "ja": "魔法学園に集う52人、そこで繰り広げられる\nストーリー……大勢の人に、届けてくれたまえ！", "zh": "聚集于魔法学园的52人，以及在那里上演的故事……请把它传达给更多人吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1025_p", "source_sha256": "bad90dc34a995245ffa7c6cdb5b354d37268a974b78aa18ae233b7a9a010704a", "ja": "はい、もちろんです！　みんなの魅力を、\n余すところなく届けたいと思います！", "zh": "好的，当然！我想把大家的魅力毫无保留地传达给更多人！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0255_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0255_story_intro_1026_101kot", "source_sha256": "58271fe96f404988d7a1371c063c2a64886f5041f3ec1097a8f11aa424748c6a", "ja": "今回は、どんな関係性が見れるのかしら……。\n私も今から楽しみです！　ふふっ。", "zh": "这次能看到怎样的关系呢……\n我从现在起就开始期待了！呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
